<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>HowlBeats — Terms of Service</title>
  <meta name="description" content="HowlBeats Terms of Service — please read before using the bot or dashboard.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
  <link rel="icon" href="<%= botClient.user ? botClient.user.displayAvatarURL({ size: 64 }) : '/furry-avatar.jpg' %>">
  <style>
    .legal-page { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 6rem 2rem 4rem; }
    .legal-page h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .legal-page .legal-meta { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
    .legal-page h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); margin: 2.2rem 0 0.6rem; }
    .legal-page p, .legal-page li { color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.97rem; }
    .legal-page ul { padding-left: 1.4rem; margin: 0.5rem 0; }
    .legal-page ul li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .legal-page a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; }
    .legal-page a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .legal-divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); margin: 2rem 0; }
    .legal-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; background: rgba(0,184,217,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(0,184,217,0.2); border-radius: 999px; padding: 0.3rem 1rem; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('header', { currentPage: '' }) %>

<div class="legal-page">
  <div class="legal-badge">📄 Legal Document</div>
  <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
  <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: May 10, 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Effective immediately</p>

  <p>Welcome to <strong>HowlBeats</strong>. By inviting the bot to your Discord server, using the web dashboard, or otherwise accessing any HowlBeats service, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use HowlBeats.</p>

  <hr class="legal-divider">

  <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
  <p>These Terms apply to all users of HowlBeats, including server administrators, moderators, and regular members. By using HowlBeats you confirm that you are at least 13 years old and meet Discord's minimum age requirement in your jurisdiction.</p>

  <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
  <p>HowlBeats is a Discord music bot and accompanying web dashboard. It provides:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Music playback from 11+ platforms via Lavalink v4</li>
    <li>Queue management, audio filters, and DJ controls</li>
    <li>A web dashboard for server settings and live queue viewing</li>
    <li>Discord OAuth2 login for dashboard access</li>
  </ul>
  <p>HowlBeats is provided free of charge and on an "as-is" basis.</p>

  <h2>3. Acceptable Use</h2>
